{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GamePlugin","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sendable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Plugins","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/AddingCustomVerbs","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/WritingRules"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A plugin bundles the player-typeable vocabulary a system needs ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"buy"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"attack"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ask"},{"type":"text","text":") with the logic that reacts to it, so the system can be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shipped once and reused instead of hand-copied into every game."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["struct CommercePlugin: GamePlugin {","    static let buy = Intent(\"buy\")","","    var verbs: [SyntaxRule] {","        SyntaxRule(\"buy\", .directObject, intent: Self.buy)","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Logic-only: a plugin owns no state","anchor":"Logic-only-a-plugin-owns-no-state"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Unlike a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameContent"},{"type":"text","text":" bundle, a plugin is "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}]},{"type":"text","text":" reflected by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bootstrap, so it declares no rooms, items, or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Global"},{"type":"text","text":" state of its own. It"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"operates entirely over entities and globals the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"host"}]},{"type":"text","text":" declares, receiving"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what it needs as parameters. That keeps a plugin portable: it makes no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"assumptions about the host’s world beyond the traits and intents it agrees"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on. A plugin that genuinely needs to ship its own content is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameContent"},{"type":"text","text":" bundle instead (list it in the game’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"content"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"The host opts in by splicing","anchor":"The-host-opts-in-by-splicing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The host stores the plugin as a plain property and splices its vocabulary,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"default actions, and rules into its own blocks. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"verbs"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"actions"},{"type":"text","text":" each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"merge just like a game’s own, and the plugin’s rule factories return"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Rules"},{"type":"text","text":" the host composes in. Together, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"verbs"},{"type":"text","text":" + "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"actions"},{"type":"text","text":" let a plugin"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ship a whole verb behavior — vocabulary and stage-4 default — without any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"host rules at all; a host only needs its own rules to embellish or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"override that default for specific entities."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["struct LampShop: Game {","    let commerce = CommercePlugin()","    @Global var purse = Purse(coins: 10)","    let lantern = Item { name(\"brass lantern\"); trait(.price, 5) }","","    var verbs: [SyntaxRule] { commerce.verbs }","    var rules: Rules {","        commerce.purchase(of: lantern,","                          balance: { purse.coins },","                          charge:  { purse.coins -= $0 })","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The protocol’s own "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/rules"},{"type":"text","text":" requirement carries only self-contained,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"world-scoped rules that need nothing from the host. Rules that must reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"host entities are exposed as "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"parameterized methods"}]},{"type":"text","text":" returning "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Rules"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"purchase(of:balance:charge:)"},{"type":"text","text":" above), which the host calls with its own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"declarations — every line still readable in the host’s source."}]}]}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/actions","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/command","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/gameText","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/player","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/rules","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/statusFields","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/timers","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/verbs","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/world"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties"}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Composing Large Games","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/SplittingAGameAcrossFiles","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ContentBundles","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Plugins","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameContent","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameContents","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ScoreDeclaring"],"anchor":"Composing-Large-Games"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A reusable game system — commerce, combat, dialog, magic — packaged as an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"importable unit of "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"verbs"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"rules"}]},{"type":"text","text":", that a host game opts into."}],"metadata":{"title":"GamePlugin","modules":[{"name":"Gnusto"}],"externalID":"s:6Gnusto10GamePluginP","symbolKind":"protocol","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"GamePlugin","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GamePlugin","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Protocol"},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Inherits From","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"inheritsFrom"}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnusto\/gameplugin"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"references":